---
description: Soul Rhythm static prototype conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

- Static prototype: plain HTML, CSS, vanilla JS only. No frameworks, no npm, no build step.
- Single-page app: index.html, styles.css, app.js. Screens switch via JS, no reloads.
- Use the exact copy text from BRIEF.md, don't rewrite it.
- Mobile-first, every interaction works by tap, respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Keep code simple. Don't add features not in the brief.
